{"id":"brx5a59f4bm7ab6z7jjux9km6","title":"复旦大学蒋永祥/皮妍团队在《表型组学》发表ADAMTSL4相关晶状体脱位与瞳孔异位机制研究","originalTitle":"[转载]Phenomics | 蒋永祥、皮妍、陈泽旭团队揭示 ADAMTSL4 相关晶状体脱位与瞳孔异位新机制","summary":"复旦大学附属眼耳鼻喉科医院蒋永祥团队联合复旦大学生命科学学院皮妍团队在《表型组学》发表研究，基于702个先天性晶状体脱位家系遗传分析，发现ADAMTSL4双等位突变致病率达3.28%，其中26.09%患者伴随瞳孔异位。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3558836&do=blog&id=1561615"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T05:08:52.407Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T05:08:52.407Z","category":"gene-cell","tags":["研究成果"],"score":75,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}